<title>LATVIA: FLEET JUMPS, UNIBANKA EXTENDS GAINS AT FIX.</title>
<headline>FLEET JUMPS, UNIBANKA EXTENDS GAINS AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Riga Transport Fleet advanced</p>
<p>significantly and Unibanka extended gains as official list</p>
<p>stocks were stable to higher after the morning trade session on</p>
<p>Thursday.</p>
<p>Fleet rose to 1.43 lats from 1.27 lats and Unibanka added</p>
<p>another three santimes to 3.39 lats.</p>
